{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO OUT NOW!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try the first steps of <i>One Step Further</i> today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience how difficult it is to control a drunk guy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will support: Russian, English, Italian, Japanese, Chinese, Portuguese, and Spanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WOULD YOU CLIMB A MOUNTAIN TO FIND SOMEONE WHO WAS LOST?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover The Mountain of Wishes, a crumbling mountain where only the strongest can reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you reach the top, the Mountain will grant you your most cherished wish. Find out what this bald man's wish is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here you will find other people seeking the same purpose in life; some will find what they wanted, others simply got lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You control a directionless man who left everything behind to climb a Mountain and find his life's purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be careful! Every step is precise, keep your balance like a drunk and rethink your steps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Climbing can be a challenge if you are not careful and patient!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHEN THE SKY FADES, MELODIES SOFTLY EMERGE GUIDING YOUR STEPS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/05228_2_.gif?t=1749509030\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HAVE YOU EVER WONDERED WHAT PURPOSE YOU ARE LOOKING FOR IN LIFE?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/GIF002.gif?t=1749509030\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INTRODUCING</strong>: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics-based climbing and walking, with a focus on realistic balance. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character balance mechanics \u2014 keep our (slightly tipsy) adventurer on his feet! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic day and night cycle, with real-time transitions accompanied by soothing soundtracks at each sunrise and sunset. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Independent use of legs and arms \u2014 coordination is everything here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE GUARDIAN BEAST OF THE MOUNTAIN AWAITS YOU!!!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/Dragon__2_.gif?t=1749509030\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Patch Notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fixed an issue at the end of the demo where a missing platform prevented players from finishing the route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minor general stability improvements implemented.<br>Thank you all for the feedback!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741250?t=1749509030","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741250?t=1749509030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/2fcd7e88c992f88a6e600cb24b3aa3e1ac5f0b0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749509030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/2fcd7e88c992f88a6e600cb24b3aa3e1ac5f0b0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749509030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3760320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO OUT NOW!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try the first steps of <i>One Step Further</i> today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience how difficult it is to control a drunk guy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will support: Russian, English, Italian, Japanese, Chinese, Portuguese, and Spanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WOULD YOU CLIMB A MOUNTAIN TO FIND SOMEONE WHO WAS LOST?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover The Mountain of Wishes, a crumbling mountain where only the strongest can reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you reach the top, the Mountain will grant you your most cherished wish. Find out what this bald man's wish is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here you will find other people seeking the same purpose in life; some will find what they wanted, others simply got lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You control a directionless man who left everything behind to climb a Mountain and find his life's purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be careful! Every step is precise, keep your balance like a drunk and rethink your steps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Climbing can be a challenge if you are not careful and patient!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHEN THE SKY FADES, MELODIES SOFTLY EMERGE GUIDING YOUR STEPS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/05228_2_.gif?t=1749509030\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HAVE YOU EVER WONDERED WHAT PURPOSE YOU ARE LOOKING FOR IN LIFE?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/GIF002.gif?t=1749509030\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INTRODUCING</strong>: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics-based climbing and walking, with a focus on realistic balance. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character balance mechanics \u2014 keep our (slightly tipsy) adventurer on his feet! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic day and night cycle, with real-time transitions accompanied by soothing soundtracks at each sunrise and sunset. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Independent use of legs and arms \u2014 coordination is everything here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE GUARDIAN BEAST OF THE MOUNTAIN AWAITS YOU!!!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/extras/Dragon__2_.gif?t=1749509030\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Patch Notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fixed an issue at the end of the demo where a missing platform prevented players from finishing the route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minor general stability improvements implemented.<br>Thank you all for the feedback!</p></li></ul>","developers":["SlidMount"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741250/647f557a6ba2eafcdea8a7db3208793f0d046332/header.jpg?t=1749509030","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight